  "description": "Pure C# MRZ (machine readable zone) reader for identity documents. Locates the MRZ in a photo, recognizes the OCR-B characters in managed code, and parses all ICAO 9303 formats (TD1, TD2, TD3, MRV) with full check digit validation. Includes fast MRZ area detection, calibrated confidence, and a multi-frame video session for camera capture. No native binaries, no ML runtimes.",
